	)
	(text "CL: DESAT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 182.792 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d8f4725-fc14-5512-b84c-ddb219ed4ca9")
	)
	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-10.0 V) - Rs - 2 x US1M - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 251.772 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1521211e-035f-5e38-bb57-3658f54a02a9")
	)
	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.536 170.292 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3783983e-9350-5068-b7d8-918eb65a73ce")
	)
	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 549.879 106.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "434a13ef-3869-5cfc-a05f-5e2625f8e821")
	)
	(text "Gate and Kelvin of each device as coupled pairs of equal length from the COM star; Ron, Roff, Kelvin R, 10k + 1n,\nZeners and the clamp FET + C_VL at each device (loop <= 1 nH). PNP followers next to their three gates. DESAT\nstring >= 2.5 mm pad gap per diode; coat to PD1. Miller hold of six gates NOT simulated - BENCH TEST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 307.696 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "484a0b47-9a64-59df-b3ad-ed38184a0a6d")
	)
	(text "CL: TURN-OFF BUFFER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.387 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "48ce4c39-de71-5b5c-b661-631b2d076c5e")
	)
	(text "CL: DRIVER AND 6 GATES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.536 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7480e1ea-ac2d-5a57-9d20-607ab77b6812")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 661.2298 82.392 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8c2ecb20-a632-5d03-8f73-ffdb163e807a")
	)
	(text "2 x ZXTP25040DFH emitter followers on OUTL (B-E 1k, C to VEE): each sinks the Roff current of 3 gates;\nthe NSI6651 supplies base current only. Turn-on stays on OUTH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.387 71.252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9aa01daf-af7e-514b-a2b8-1f83072c4b8d")
	)
	(text "SN6505B push-pull 420 kHz from +5V_GD, BIAS_EN high = on; T_BIAS4 custom, functional insulation\n(PD-free >= 1.75 kVpk, <= 5 pF per secondary). Per channel: bridge, PNP regulator VDD-VEE, ATL431 COM split."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109 277.696 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bbf58b4d-173c-516b-bf78-76fa2feb2f15")
	)
	(text "IN+ = own PWM; IN- = complementary switch, falling edge stretched 3.65k/100p\n(interlock + min dead time = max(firmware, hardware)). Bias PG (active low) pulls RDY low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 107.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c0b42d92-e5e2-5465-bacd-b22617e2dcd3")
	)
